    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
